---
/** 一两个条件就能完成的示例卡并排两列；窄屏一列 */
---

<div class="lx-recipe-grid not-content"><slot /></div>

<style>
	.lx-recipe-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
	}

	.lx-recipe-grid :global(.lx-recipe) {
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 40rem) {
		.lx-recipe-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
